  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "咿——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "小心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "我沒事，只是擦傷而已，不要緊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "還不夠......再這樣下去，包圍圈會越來越小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "我們已經找到了可突破口，但沒有增援，我們只能採取守勢，沒法突圍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......請再堅持一下！優先用火力壓制敵方射手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "敵人的先鋒，就由我們術師來處理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "沒錯，沒錯！就該這樣！接下來，f3，e5！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可憎的小子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "很好！那麼，b4，b5！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "敵人正在向我們側後方迂回！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "調兩位重裝幹員和一位狙擊幹員！只要能牽制他們就足夠了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "之後！h2，h6！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "他們，他們在衝擊我們的陣線！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "近衛幹員，把敵人趕出掩體！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "沒錯，再讓我多看一會兒，你們掙扎的樣子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "現在，術師，c7，吃掉敵人的戰車吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "敵人的術師現身了......！之前，一直躲在重裝幹員身後嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "來不及了！趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "嗚啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "然後就去死吧，就像雨夜中的火星一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "他，是在指揮自己的隊伍嗎......！僅僅運用象棋走法，就能下達精準的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "明明都是些狂暴的感染者，戰鬥卻完全由他一人指揮......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "再這樣下去，他會把指揮優勢發揮到極致——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "相應的，只要能壓制他的話，也就沒什麼大不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不要讓整合運動打開哪怕一丁點缺口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "混帳，我們的時間越來越少了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不能再讓整合運動拖延我們的腳步了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "有什麼，有什麼辦法能迅速打開局面嗎......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果繼續拖下去，博士和大家就......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔唔唔唔唔啊啊啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......唔唔......怎麼回事？怎麼有人被......撞飛起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "你們的速度比我估算的慢上太多了，我可是連平民都順手安頓好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "別擋路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "嗚啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "加大進攻力度！別給敵人重整陣形的機會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "臨光小姐！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "你沒事就好，阿米婭。快撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "幸虧這次作戰，有你參加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "訊號彈的定位很有效。看來你們遇到的麻煩確實不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "您就是{@nickname}博士吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "耀騎士臨光，前來迎接你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
